4. PROCEDURES BEFORE RVSM AIRSPACE ENTRY. If any of the required equipment fails prior to the aircraft entering RVSM airspace, the pilot should request a new clearance so as to avoid flight in this airspace. The following equipment should be operating normally at entry into RVSM airspace:

