iv. Five departures and arrivals to strips likely to be used on tasking in PNG (based on aircraft type);

v. Been awarded a PNG captaincy by OC 173 Sqn on recommendation from 173 Sqn Check and Training captain;

vi. Retained currency in PNG operations by operating in country at least in the preceding 12 months.

