b) the volumes of airspace within which MSAW is implemented;

c) the method of displaying the MSAW to the controller;

d) in general terms, the parameters for generation of alerts as well as alert warning time;

e) the volumes of airspace within which MSAW can be selectively inhibited and the conditions under which this will be permitted as well as applicable procedures;

f) conditions under which MSAW alerts may be inhibited for individual flights as well as applicable procedures.

